s possible for release.We also have a little update for the demo. You can now try out the new small talks feature as well as selfie gallery! PLAY THE FREE DEMO NOW!Once you’ve tried it, please leave us your feedback in the commen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:48:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030278","verified_at":"2026-10-21T23:02:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4366900-1844115010496840","game_id":"steam-4366900","kind":"announcement","title":"THANK YOU FOR 10,000 WISHLISTS! 🍺 🍺","summary":"YAYYY!! We officially passed 10,000 wishlists! Seeing this many people interested in our silly little gooner bar game means a ton to us. And the good news is: development is getting pretty far along!Most of the writing, artwork, and animations are already finished, and right now we're busy putting everything together in-game, polishing things up, and making sure everything works properly. Our current goal is to release the full game before the end of the year!And since we just hit 10K, we figure","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T08:50:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:45:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4366900-1842846814440944","game_id":"steam-4366900","kind":"announcement","title":"Our FREE DEMO is here!! Try it now!","summary":"Hello there, fellow gooners!Today is a big day for us: the first demo of I Opened an Idle Bar So I Can GOON to HOT GIRLS! is officially available!Build up your bar, serve increasingly expensive drinks, earn ridiculous amounts of money, and pursue your true entrepreneurial dream: fucking hot girls.PLAY THE FREE DEMO NOW!Meet Morgan, the first girl to wander into your bar. She may be a little creepy and unsettling, also possibly a vampire—but most importantly, she’s hot. Upgrade your bar and play ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T16:29:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440944","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:45:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4366900-1842212951303110","game_id":"steam-4366900","kind":"announcement","title":"Hentai vs Furry Championship Festival 2026","summary":"Welcome to the First-Ever Worldwide HENTAI vs FURRY FESTIVAL 🤩😮Your eyes are about to witness a great battle between two major genres in the Adult Games category - Hentai and Furry. The winning genre will be the one that receives the most votes! More than 400 Steam pages are taking part in the festival.🗓️ Festival Dates: August 27 – September 10Festival Link: https://store.steampowered.com/developer/Horny_Capybara/sale/HentaiFurry2026If you choose Hentai, publish any post on X (Twitter) using th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T12:45:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303110","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:45:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4366900-1832065502820480","game_id":"steam-4366900","kind":"announcement","title":"2,000 WISHLISTS IN 5 DAYS ?????!!!!!!!!!","summary":"Honestly… what the hell. Those numbers are insane.We genuinely never expected the game to grow this fast in such a short amount of time, so thank you so much for all the support, wishes, comments, and people sharing the game around. It really means a lot to us.To celebrate, here’s some new art as a reward for all the support 💖We also want to give a huge thank you to the Steam Adult Game Festival for bringing so many people to the game. The event has been absolutely crazy.Please also check out th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-11T06:45:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502820480","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:45:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4366900-1830163047254147","game_id":"steam-4366900","kind":"announcement","title":"🍺 THANK YOU FOR 1,000 WISHLISTS! 🔥","summary":"Didn’t expect to hit this milestone so soon. Seriously, thank you.We’re grinding hard on the first playable demo right now, getting everything in shape so you can actually try the game soon.On the art side, we’re in polish mode:Finishing CGsSmoothing animationsMaking everything look clean, fluid, and sexyStill a lot of work, but we’re getting there.Demo coming soon 👀 Stay tuned and wishlist if you haven’t already!👉 Wishlist the game here:Much love, Jisas and Dinotonte Team❤️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-15T08:02:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047254147","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:45:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4366900-1823825466502150","game_id":"steam-4366900","kind":"announcement","title":"🍺THE GOON BAR IS LIVE - New NSFW Game by Dinotonte!🍺","summary":"We’re super happy (and excited 👀) to announce that I Opened an Idle Bar So I Can GOON to HOT GIRLS finally has its Steam store page live! 🎉 We’re aiming to release the game later this year, so stay tuned.This is a brand-new adult idle game by Dinotonte, where you run and grow a bar with one clear goal in mind: maximize profits, optimize upgrades, and attract extremely hot customers… who are very interested in you 😏🍻 What to expectIdle / management-style gameplayBar upgrades and drinks5 very attr","occurre